    /// deeplink / activity / switch-mode / login) with the current Context.
    /// `context` carries the current instrument (Rust session-owned) so native
    /// routes instrument-dependent destinations without reading OKTradeCore
    /// `SelectBizManager`. `telemetry` carries the Rust-computed tracking params
    /// (button_name / instrument_type / is_demo / tab / more_* name) so native
