/// TP/SL summary rows for the confirm dialog. Each row is `None` when the leg
/// is not configured; when `Some`, it carries an [`OKTLabeledValueVo`] whose
/// `title` is the leg-label CDKey and whose `value` is a render-ready
/// `DisplayString` (Native only calls `.resolve(ctx)` — H-1 / H-2).
/// 
/// SIBLING-PARITY: rows use `OKTLabeledValueVo` / `DisplayString` exactly like
/// the spot-market confirm (the user-directed style), NOT the raw-`String`
/// shape of the limit confirm (its tech-debt).
