/// the native `MultiTpDetailView` / `MultiSlDetailView` row (`fromConfirm = true`):
/// 3 columns - trigger price / order price / amount (position percent). All
/// values are render-ready `DisplayString` (Native only calls `.resolve(ctx)`).
