/// Kotlin source: `OKTDexTpslUpdateResponse`.
/// Contains the UOP hash and server signing options needed for passkey signing,
/// similar to [`super::dex_order::DexConfirmResponse`].
/// 
/// **Note**: The API returns `Vec<DexTpslUpdateResponse>` in the outer `data` array;
/// callers must take `first()`.
