/// - `echo_rows` non-empty      -> Trailing/MULTI read-only echo rows.
/// - `oco_echo_active`          -> advance-confirmed OCO echo; the panel
/// repaints from the kernel OCO config (`current_oco_echo_config`).
/// - otherwise inline mode      -> editable boxes; `blank_*_box` say per
/// leg whether the ByPrice box must be blanked (kernel leg truly
/// cleared). A no-op close leaves the kernel untouched -> false -> the
/// typed inline value is preserved (aeeb0943073 parity, now kernel-side).
