    /// + this state's avg/liq). INVERSE contracts show current-fiat (USD->CNY); the
    /// raw `last_price` (A2.1 grouping-only) shows raw USD for inverse. Kotlin renders
    /// `.resolve(ctx)` instead of `formatRustNumber(last_price)`.
