    /// against `PositionAssetManager`'s WS-populated snapshot. The list-scoped
    /// `PurePositionAssetListInteractor::create_close_interactor` path stays for
    /// in-list launches; this path serves facade entries (e.g. K-line
    /// quick-close) that have no live list interactor, where the snapshot would
    /// be empty and the factory would return `None`.
