/// Read-only accessor letting the NATIVE cohort's sheet obtain the same Rust-owned body-variant
/// decision as the Rust-backed cohort.
/// 
/// The native sheet has no interactor for this surface, so it cannot read the variant off state.
/// This is exposed as a `uniffi::Object` with a method rather than a free-standing
/// `#[uniffi::export] pub fn` on purpose: a bare exported function would be an uncontrolled
/// cross-module entry point, whereas an Object keeps the decision behind a named owner. Kotlin
/// imports the Object type, which is the allowed shape.
