    /// Round 3.3 — run the BBO pre-submit gate against the current state.
    /// 
    /// V1 parity: `SpotAdvancedLimitTradePanelPresenter.kt:716-728
    /// checkOrderPrice` → `tradePresenter.checkOrderExceedBbo`. Pure check;
    /// when a warning fires, emits `ShowBboWarningDialog` so the Kotlin
    /// Fragment handler can render the 2-button OK/Cancel dialog. Returns
