    /// Initialize trade core with specific data types (cancellable)
    /// 
    /// Type-safe initialization using enum variants instead of strings.
    /// Supports cancellation via OKCancellationToken.
    /// 
    /// # Arguments
    /// * `data_types` - Array of data type enum variants, e.g.:
    /// - FFITradeDataType::InstGroup
    /// - FFITradeDataType::Coins
    /// - FFITradeDataType::Spot
    /// * `cancel_token` - Cancellation token to allow cancelling the operation
    /// 
    /// # Returns
